  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistical Development - Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Statistics Norway for a broad institutional cooperation to build statistical capacity at the Statistics Agency in Ukraine (SSSU). The project will contribute to evidence-based planning for optimal ressoruce allocation and improved welfare across the Ukrainian society through improved availability of Statistics to users and more and better official statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
